/div></div></div></section>
  
  <section class="panel"><h2>Token composition</h2>
  <p class="panel-sub">Share of 0 total tokens by type — the raw sum is dominated by the cheapest kind, so judge by composition and cache hit rate, not the big number.</p>
  <div class="stacked-bar"></div><div class="legend"><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-in"></span><span class="legend-label">input · 1×</span><span class="legend-value">0 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-out"></span><span class="legend-label">output</span><span class="legend-value">0 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-cw"></span><span class="legend-label">cache write · 1.25×</span><span class="legend-value">0 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-cr"></span><span class="legend-label">cache read · 0.1×</span><span class="legend-value">0 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div></div></section>
  <section class="panel"><h2>Orchestrator (lead thread) composition</h2>
  <p class="panel-sub">n/a · real work 0 · cache hit n/a</p>
  <div class="stacked-bar"></div><div class="legend"><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-in"></span><span class="legend-label">input · 1×</span><span class="legend-value">0 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-out"></span><span class="legend-label">output</span><span class="legend-value">0 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-cw"></span><span class="legend-label">cache write · 1.25×</span><span class="legend-value">0 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-cr"></span><span class="legend-label">cache read · 0.1×</span><span class="legend-value">0 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div></div>
  <div class="kpi-callout">A high lead share with a high cache hit rate is orchestration working as designed — context replayed per turn from cache, not runaway spend.</div></section>
  
  
  
  
