  <h1>Batch tokenomics — bt-gate</h1>
  <p class="meta">The other unfolding of the same records as batch-report (delivery view) · generated 2026-10-05T09:03:00.000Z · 1 session(s) · models: claude-opus-5</p>
  
  <section class="kpi-row"><div class="kpi-card"><h3>Cache</h3><div class="kpi-grid"><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Cache hit rate</span><span class="stat-value">100.0%</span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Prompt cost saved</span><span class="stat-value">~90.0%</span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Total cost <span class="stat-sub">measured</span></span><span class="stat-value">$10.00</span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Active time</span><span class="stat-value">1.0h</span></div></div><div class="kpi-callout">a cache write is a STORED MISS (processed fresh at ~1.25×, kept for reuse); a read replays at ~0.1× input price — cache-read ≈ 90.9% of SPEND at public ratios</div></div><div class="kpi-card"><h3>Tokens</h3><div class="kpi-grid"><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Total <span class="stat-sub">incl. cache replay</span></span><span class="stat-value">2,849,700</span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Real work <span class="stat-sub">in+out</span></span><span class="stat-value">6,700</span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Input</span><span class="stat-value">1,300</span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Output</span><span class="stat-value">5,400</span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Cache read</span><span class="stat-value">2,843,000</span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Cache write</span><span class="stat-value">0</span></div></div><div class="kpi-callout"><strong>99.8%</strong> of all tokens served from cache</div></div><div class="kpi-card"><h3>Activity</h3><div class="kpi-grid"><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Turns</span><span class="stat-value">5</span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Tool calls</span><span class="stat-value">31 <span class="stat-sub">(2 err, 94% ok)</span></span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Dispatches</span><span class="stat-value">4</span></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Sessions</span><span class="stat-value">1</span></div></div></div></section>
  
  <section class="panel"><h2>Token composition</h2>
  <p class="panel-sub">Share of 2,849,700 total tokens by type — the raw sum is dominated by the cheapest kind, so judge by composition and cache hit rate, not the big number.</p>
  <div class="stacked-bar"><div class="bar-seg s-in" style="flex:0.4 0 0" title="input · 1×: 1,300 (0.0%)"></div><div class="bar-seg s-out" style="flex:0.4 0 0" title="output: 5,400 (0.2%)"></div><div class="bar-seg s-cr" style="flex:99.76488753202092 0 0" title="cache read · 0.1×: 2,843,000 (99.8%)"></div></div><div class="legend"><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-in"></span><span class="legend-label">input · 1×</span><span class="legend-value">1,300 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-out"></span><span class="legend-label">output</span><span class="legend-value">5,400 <span class="legend-pct">(0.2%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-cw"></span><span class="legend-label">cache write · 1.25×</span><span class="legend-value">0 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-cr"></span><span class="legend-label">cache read · 0.1×</span><span class="legend-value">2,843,000 <span class="legend-pct">(99.8%)</span></span></div></div></section>
  <section class="panel"><h2>Orchestrator (lead thread) composition</h2>
  <p class="panel-sub">$5.80 · real work 5k · cache hit 100.0% · overhead incl. stages: 63% of the batch</p>
  <div class="stacked-bar"><div class="bar-seg s-in" style="flex:0.4 0 0" title="input · 1×: 1,000 (0.0%)"></div><div class="bar-seg s-out" style="flex:0.4 0 0" title="output: 4,000 (0.2%)"></div><div class="bar-seg s-cr" style="flex:99.8003992015968 0 0" title="cache read · 0.1×: 2,500,000 (99.8%)"></div></div><div class="legend"><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-in"></span><span class="legend-label">input · 1×</span><span class="legend-value">1,000 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-out"></span><span class="legend-label">output</span><span class="legend-value">4,000 <span class="legend-pct">(0.2%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-cw"></span><span class="legend-label">cache write · 1.25×</span><span class="legend-value">0 <span class="legend-pct">(0.0%)</span></span></div><div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch s-cr"></span><span class="legend-label">cache read · 0.1×</span><span class="legend-value">2,500,000 <span class="legend-pct">(99.8%)</span></span></div></div>
  <div class="kpi-callout">A high lead share with a high cache hit rate is orchestration working as designed — context replayed per turn from cache, not runaway spend.</div></section>
  <section class="panel"><h2>By role</h2><p class="panel-sub">Per-role composition; rw = real work (in+out), hit = cache hit rate. role cost = the parent session's role, inclusive of its dispatches; — (n unpriced) = n parent session(s) without dollars; — = not allocated at this grain: a dispatch-only role has no parent-session dollars (its dispatch dollars are the separate breakdown, never added to a role or the total).</p>
    <div class="row"><div class="lbl">session</div><div class="stacked"><div class="bar-seg s-in" style="flex:0.4 0 0" title="input · 1×: 1,000"></div><div class="bar-seg s-out" style="flex:0.4 0 0" title="output: 4,000"></div><div class="bar-seg s-cr" style="flex:99.8003992015968 0 0" title="cache read · 0.1×: 2,500,000"></div></div>
    <div class="num">$10.00<span class="sub"> · rw 5k · hit 100.0%</span></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="lbl">implementer</div><div class="stacked"><div class="bar-seg s-in" style="flex:0.4 0 0" title="input · 1×: 250"></div><div class="bar-seg s-out" style="flex:0.4 0 0" title="output: 1,200"></div><div class="bar-seg s-cr" style="flex:99.57534045980377 0 0" title="cache read · 0.1×: 340,000"></div></div>
    <div class="num">—<span class="sub"> · rw 1k · hit 99.9%</span></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="lbl">reviewer</div><div class="stacked"><div class="bar-seg s-in" style="flex:1.3953488372093024 0 0" title="input · 1×: 30"></div><div class="bar-seg s-out" style="flex:5.5813953488372094 0 0" title="output: 120"></div><div class="bar-seg s-cr" style="flex:93.02325581395348 0 0" title="cache read · 0.1×: 2,000"></div></div>
    <div class="num">—<span class="sub"> · rw 150 · hit 98.5%</span></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="lbl">triage</div><div class="stacked"><div class="bar-seg s-in" style="flex:1.8181818181818181 0 0" title="input · 1×: 20"></div><div class="bar-seg s-out" style="flex:7.2727272727272725 0 0" title="output: 80"></div><div class="bar-seg s-cr" style="flex:90.9090909090909 0 0" title="cache read · 0.1×: 1,000"></div></div>
    <div class="num">—<span class="sub"> · rw 100 · hit 98.0%</span></div></div></section>
